G21 (Set units to millimeters)
G90 (Absolute positioning distance mode)
G0 Z20.00 (Clearance height above spoilboard)

(Spindle Setup)
M3 S12000 (Turn spindle clockwise at 12,000 RPM)
G4 P3 (Pause for 3 seconds to let spindle reach speed)

(Point A - Origin Corner)
G0 X0.00 Y0.00
G1 Z-5.00 F750.0 (Drill down 5mm into spoilboard)
G0 Z20.00

(Point B - X Axis Leg, 375mm)
G0 X375.00 Y0.00
G1 Z-5.00 F750.0 (Drill down 5mm)
G0 Z20.00

(Point C - Y Axis Leg, 500mm)
G0 X0.00 Y500.00
G1 Z-5.00 F750.0 (Drill down 5mm)
G0 Z20.00

(Safe Retract and Shutdown)
G0 Z50.00 (Retract to safe height)
G0 X-50 Y550
M5 (Turn spindle off)
G53 G0 Z0.00
M30 (End of program)